{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "visuals",
 "version": "0.5",
 "title": "VISUALS: beat radar, a pet, screen effects, screensavers, a clock and a scope",
 "description": "Eye candy. Master pages (FUNC + LFO, then LEFT/RIGHT): RDR a beat radar, PET a creature that lives on your music, SCR the screen effects (CRT, inverted flashes, VHS noise, snow when stopped, a beat border, scanlines, a FILL glitch, DJ filter vision), SAV the screensaver (starfield, bouncing logo with your own word, pipes, falling rain, lava lamp, ferrofluid, Game of Life, Lissajous), CLK tempo, pattern, track and a tap meter, SCP a scope, XY view and spectrum, and ART: the art live, rain or a storm with lightning on accents, big track names on hits, the whole screen inverted, a start-up splash and your word as a name tag. With LED COLORS 1.0+ the trig keys follow the screensaver. Settings saved. Needs seq-events; works with djfilter 0.6+.",
 "category": "Looks",
 "author": "Cere, made with Claude",
 "license": "GPL-2.0-or-later",
 "target": {
  "device": "digitakt-mk1",
  "product": "Digitakt mk1",
  "os": "1.54",
  "syx_sha256": "f78ba80fa7b1da5fb0e1ff61ad61e9e71aafe79f4364fc49679f3651353e3cf6",
